WEBVTT

00:31:59.508 --> 00:32:03.082
Helen: Because people might
change their behavior

00:32:03.106 --> 00:32:05.541
when they're under pressure, right?

00:32:05.565 --> 00:32:07.612
George: And you're given
one sheet of paper

00:32:07.636 --> 00:32:09.732
and you're given one pen.

00:32:09.756 --> 00:32:13.781
Helen: This is to observe whether
you hog the keyboard,

00:32:13.805 --> 00:32:14.964
or the boss,

00:32:14.988 --> 00:32:16.939
or do you actually share the resources?

00:32:16.963 --> 00:32:19.021
Scott: A lot of times
you'll see people go,

00:32:19.045 --> 00:32:20.383
"OK, I'm going to do this.

00:32:20.407 --> 00:32:22.265
And they just take the pen and pencil,

00:32:22.289 --> 00:32:25.694
and they just go and their pair
partner's left going, "Huh?

00:32:25.718 --> 00:32:27.709
What am I supposed to do in this moment?"

00:32:27.733 --> 00:32:29.555
Lisa: And then after that 20 minutes,

00:32:29.579 --> 00:32:30.958
we switch their partners.